{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-03",
  "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "逼近问模型族中是否存在合适网络；优化问能否找到它；泛化问未见数据上是否有效。本讲主要回答第一问。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "函数增量由输入增量的 L 倍控制；多维输入采用 RMS 范数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 8
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "RMS 范数是坐标平方平均后开根号，用来表示多维输入增量大小。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "任意定义在单位 d 维超立方体上的 L-Lipschitz 函数，都存在三层 ReLU 网络使积分 L1 误差小于 2ε；构造规模为 4d(L/ε)^d。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 10
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N 条等宽区间内，Lipschitz 条件把单条误差限制在面积 L/(2N²) 的三角形内，总误差不超过 L/(2N)。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 12
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N 个超矩形各边长 N^{-1/d}，总误差不超过 L/N^{1/d}；达到 ε 需 (L/ε)^d 个超矩形，数量对维数指数增长。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 14
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "四个平移、缩放的 ReLU 经系数 [1,-1,-1,1] 组合，在 c→∞ 时趋近区间 [0,1] 的矩形函数；偏置可水平平移它。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "把各坐标的一维矩形相加并在 d−1 处施加 ReLU 阈值，可近似 d 维超矩形；再对平移后的超矩形做线性组合即可逼近目标曲面。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 16
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "该构造在维数上耗费指数多神经元，而且按训练点形成矩形的表示未必泛化；普适逼近本身也不是学习成功的充分条件。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 19
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ReLU、分段线性函数的和、标量乘法与复合仍为分段线性，可用梯度改变的位置 kink 衡量复杂度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "宽度为 n 的一层至多把上一层的最大 kink 数乘以 2n，因此深度 L 的上界为 (2n)^L：对固定深度是宽度的多项式，对固定宽度则随深度指数增长。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 28
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 31
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "宽度 2 的三角函数每次自复合都使线性区域数翻倍；复合 500 次产生 2^500−1 个 kinks，而三层网络要匹配需约 7×10^49 的宽度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 32
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 33
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "深度分离只支持关于逼近表达效率的结论，不能推出极深网络容易优化或泛化良好。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 34
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "d7db2ac9fdc333a6bdcf4e39659df9d0c53f2587cf68df71cf68b2dd863a462e",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-03-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    }
